<!-- The social window (TSe_EmotiomForm, Ctrl+E or the Social button); view model:
     viewmodels/SocialWindow.cpp.  The friend tab: five friends a page (the GM row first), each
     with its face, name, level, job, element, online state, nickname and guild, a mail icon and
     a tick box; Send Mail and Del Friend act on the ticked ones.  The emote tab: the Ctrl+1..5
     phrases, the emotions and actions, and the Alt+1..8 slots (an emotion or action clicked,
     then a slot, puts it there).  The setup tab: nickname, online or busy, birthday (and its
     star sign), blood type and the heart radar switch; OK hands changes in, Cancel takes them
     back.  The game draws a form's
     controls from the last created to the first: the controls here are in drawing order, the
     reverse of TSe_EmotiomForm.Create. -->
<Panel Name="SocialWindowLayer" Bounds="0,0,800,600">
  <Window Name="SocialWindow" Escape="onSocialWindowEscape" Picture="Form_Friend_2" Position="222,53" Visible="false" DoubleClick="onSocialDoubleClick">
